1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,695
This is a short test of a small robot camera.

2
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:06,190
Why did the camera stop just before the turn?

3
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:09,515
The bracket moved. The cable was pulled loose.

4
00:00:10,083 --> 00:00:13,303
Wow, one loose cable changes the whole test.

5
00:00:13,833 --> 00:00:17,128
Now hold the cable in place and run the test again.

6
00:00:17,667 --> 00:00:20,757
Crazy how much steadier the picture looks now.

7
00:00:21,292 --> 00:00:24,457
What should we measure next? Compare both runs.
